{"title": "Elixir of Dragonborn Prowess: Frost", "pageid": 18454, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elixir_of_Dragonborn_Prowess:_Frost", "categories": ["Elixirs", "Rare items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bottle_A_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Bottle_A_Icon.png/300px-Bottle_A_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/3/39/Bottle_A_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Elixir of Dragonborn Prowess: Frost image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Bottle_A_Icon.png/300px-Bottle_A_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Bottle_A_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Elixir of Dragonborn Prowess: Frost</span></a> is a unique rare <a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\">Elixir</a> made up of all of a frost dragonborn's best qualities distilled into a bottle.\n\nYou have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on Intimidation and Persuasion <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> to Cold damage, and can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Storm\" title=\"Ice Storm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp/25px-Ice_Storm_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp/38px-Ice_Storm_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp/50px-Ice_Storm_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ice Storm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp/25px-Ice_Storm_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Ice_Storm_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Storm\" title=\"Ice Storm\">Ice Storm</a> once until your next <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>One of Blood Vendor Araj Oblodra's elixirs, distilled from a specific sanguine quality, and with properties aligned to an equally specific race.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/15px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/23px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/30px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elixirs\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/15px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"15\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\">Elixirs</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Single Use\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Single Use</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb